Objective
We want to evaluate your skills in frontend development, backend development, and data engineering (scraping + processing). The task is to build a Profile Page for an Instagram Influencer that showcases data and insights in a clean, user-friendly interface.

This assignment will help us understand:
1. Your ability to design intuitive, responsive, and modern frontend UI.
2. Your ability to build a backend service that fetches, stores, and processes data.
3. Your data handling and processing capabilities (scraping, analyzing, enriching data).
4. Your code structure, best practices, and ability to deliver an end-to-end feature.
Problem Statement
Build a web application that displays the profile of an Instagram influencer.
Basic Information (mandatory)
- Influencer Name
- Username (@handle)
- Profile Picture
- Followers count
- Following count
- Number of Posts
Engagement & Analytics (mandatory)
- Average likes per post
- Average comments per post
- Engagement rate (%)
Post-Level Data (important)
- Recent posts (at least last 10) with:
  - Post image/thumbnail
  - Caption text
  - Likes count
  - Comments count
- Image-level analysis (via image processing):
  - Auto-generate keywords/tags describing the post (e.g., 'food', 'travel', 'fashion')
  - Classify vibe/ambience of the post (e.g., 'casual', 'aesthetic', 'luxury/lavish', 'energetic')
  - Generate quality indicators (e.g., lighting, visual appeal, consistency)
Reels/Video-Level Data (advanced)
- Recent reels (at least 5) with:
  - Reel thumbnail
  - Caption text
  - Views, Likes, Comments
- Video-level analysis (via basic video processing):
  - Identify events or objects in the reel (e.g., 'person dancing', 'beach', 'car')
  - Classify vibe/ambience/lavishness similar to posts (e.g., 'party', 'travel luxury', 'casual daily life')
  - Extract basic descriptive tags (e.g., 'outdoor', 'nightlife', 'food review')
Bonus Feature (Optional but Highly Valued)
- Audience Demographics Visualization
  - Show inferred demographics of the influencer’s audience (e.g., gender split, age groups, geography).
  - The approach to do this will be a difficult thing hence valuable.
  - A clear flow/UI for showcasing this will add significant bonus points.
Technical Requirements
Backend
- Build a scraping pipeline to gather influencer data from Instagram.
  - Use Instagram public data and if scraping is restricted, any approach to by-pass restrictions will be a bonus.
  - Store the data in a database (SQL or NoSQL).
- Implement a REST or GraphQL API to serve influencer profile + post/reel data to the frontend.
- Implement at least basic image and video processing using libraries (e.g., OpenCV, TensorFlow, PyTorch, or external ML APIs).
Frontend
- Build a responsive profile page using React (or any modern frontend framework of your choice)..
- Showcase influencer’s profile, analytics, posts, and reels in a structured and visually appealing way.
- Include charts/graphs for engagement metrics (e.g., likes vs. comments trend, post categories).
- Ensure smooth navigation and UX.
